MPR/ScreenRecording*

# Python caches
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- not published --------------------------------------------------------
# These hold the private pages in the clear. The site publishes only their
# encrypted twins (*.enc, see scripts/tools/build_private.py); the plaintext
# stays on this machine. Untracking them is what makes the pages private —
# a client-side gate would not, since this repo is public.
m2-private.html
papers/private-ideas.json
papers/reviews.json
papers/tools/
assets/projects/m2/read-the-room.pdf
assets/projects/m2/supplement.pdf
papers/.private-manifest.json
